@@ -0,0 +1,99 @@
+# Apple returns complete material current to the temporal receiver
+
+[project-postulate] Brandon's resumed AS4–AS5 goal requires useful sound, then recorded English
+and conversational conduct through the same native ecology. This return continues that goal;
+device parity and a temporal port do not complete it. The active order remains in
+[the Apple blueprint](../../docs/plans/HOLONICS_ON_APPLE_SILICON.md).
+
+## Shared construction and Apple realization
+
+[established-bounded; source-inspected] Desktop `e577d9b3` was integrated into
+`codex/apple-silicon` by `9c730f3c`. Its
+[material-mode construction](2026-09-07_AC1_THE_SHARED_DRIVE_MODE_REACHES_THE_LEARNED_MATERIAL_CURRENT.md)
+receives the existing complete material map on a shared-drive mode, retaining its remainder,
+births, source occurrence, producing/current operator cuts and oriented numerical defects.
+The mode's alternating occurrence progression supplies no acoustic frequency.
+
+[established-bounded; implemented-exact] The Apple implementation adds
+`accelerators/metal/field_history_integer.metal`, `field_current_history_source.metal`,
+`field_complete_material_transport.metal`, `field_material_mode.metal` and
+`field_differential_receiver.metal`. Their source owners remain the corresponding CUDA headers
+and `native_ecology/constitutive_fibre/field/{current_history_source,material_transport/complete}.rs`.
+The complete field stages its material proposal after the junction and publishes the continuing
+field, coefficients and history only after the complete return succeeds. Signed-magnitude
+256-bit birth moments, pairings and numerical contractions remain native integers; packed
+128-bit currents retain their existing wire and all outward error terms.
+
+[established-bounded; implemented-exact] The shared field launch now has 37 arguments. Metal
+retains thirty buffers in their original order and packs six u32 fields plus the u64 occurrence
+into its final seven-ulong constant buffer. Source-history scratch uses
+`constitutive_wide_scratch(12*nodes)`, including Metal's twenty-byte wide carrier. Immutable
+factor tables use actual GPU addresses. The mount resolves only exterior pointer columns,
+retains the addressed allocations with the captured command and declares indirect read residency.
+This follows Metal's [argument-buffer resource rules](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/metal/managing-groups-of-resources-with-argument-buffers).
+Numerical factor/source carriers are never read on the host for this launch. Unsupported
+indirect addressing returns an apparatus obstruction.
+
+## Temporal composition
+
+[established-bounded; implemented-exact] `read_complete_material_source_resident` now returns
+`NativeCompleteMaterialSourceReturn`: an immutable completed native report with its actual
+source lineage and producing/current cuts. Its `temporal_view` borrows all field nodes as an
+enclosed phase section with the caller's declared receiver, origin and clock. The old cold
+`read_complete_material_source` is preserved through the explicit `inspect` receiver.
+`NativeMaterialModeReturn::temporal_view` and the unfolding counterpart retain component identity,
+births and cuts while exposing the same existing temporal consumer. None selects a centre as
+an exact native current or equates a numerical ball with the causal Preimage Fibre.
+
+[established-bounded; measured] Two new native controls verify cold equivalence, nonzero learned
+mode/full components, exact component/cut metadata, resident convolution and oriented comparison,
+zero numerical readout during that composition, and preservation of completed views after a
+later field operation. A borrowed temporal chart does not itself establish recording provenance
+or an impulse-response interpretation; the application must supply the actual interaction.
+
+## Returned checks
+
+[established-bounded; measured] On the M1 Pro, development build:
+
+| Check | Return |
+|---|---|
+| `cargo test -p mount --lib -- --test-threads=1` | 12 pass, including captured indirect-factor lifetime, offsets and dangling-address refusal |
+| Complete material family, `--include-ignored --test-threads=1` | 9 pass, including exact source-qualified reconstruction, delayed source, remount, late refusal and both temporal controls; 14.81 s |
+| Internal modes, field differential receiver and base field controls | 20 pass; 1.20 s |
+| Admitted current-history controls, complete junction, resident ingress and enclosed temporal consumers | 27 pass; 5.69 s |
+| Public `native_material_mode` | Every JSON field matches the desktop receipt except `whole_seconds`; Apple 1.765004291 s, desktop 0.163803609 s |
+
+[established-bounded; measured] The public command was
+`cargo run -p holonic-engine --no-default-features --example native_material_mode -- .local/experiments/apple-material-mode-return.json`.
+The [portable Apple receipt](2026-09-07_apple_material_current/return.json) and
+[desktop receipt](2026-09-07_material_mode/return.json) preserve the complete comparison.
+Before/after material-mode queries each use one deed, zero section readouts and zero numerical
+egress; their exterior address tables ingress 64 and 96 bytes respectively. Frozen unfolding
+after the source field is dropped uses one deed, no ingress and no numerical egress. Explicit
+cold inspection is outside those counters. Existing unrelated build warnings remain.
+
+[established-bounded; source-inspected] The outgoing-only `CoupledOutgoing` material variant
+remains unported; its pre-launch refusal preserves the complete old field. Accordingly the
+current-history test `complete_sources_keep_complex_phase_births_recharts_and_late_returns`,
+which explicitly enables that variant, is excluded from the 27-test set. The complete-current
+family independently verifies complex phase, rechart and delayed-source construction. CUDA
+compilation/execution was not performed on this Mac; the shared Rust wire and CUDA source were
+inspected, and the public comparison uses the checked-in desktop measurement.
+
+## Next acoustic attachment
+
+[established-bounded; source-inspected] Complete current history currently admits an integral
+root-contact chart: the actual covariance denominator is one and every contact coordinate must
+divide by its common denominator exactly. The existing refusal control preserves the old
+coefficients and recoverable source when that domain is exceeded. `AcousticFieldChart` retains
+the exterior PCM divisor explicitly; normalized PCM cannot silently change units to enter this
+domain. Integer PCM codewords are an available declared digital chart, with their own metric
+and reconstruction boundary, not calibrated pressure.
+
+[open] Bind actual recorded excitation/receiver contact and its complete temporal support to
+this material owner. A predicted microphone section is a section in its receiving clock; use
+convolution only when a separately founded delay-response chart supplies that role. Preserve
+excluded support, the actual full source remainder and all numerical enclosures. Then develop
+and inspect useful sound conduct across recordings, continue the same owner through rest and
+streaming, and extend it to useful recorded English and conversation. The existing four-tap
+temporal contact remains bounded evidence, not an acoustic organization or usefulness claim.
